# --- Transient artifacts ---------------------------------------------------
# Experiment results under runs/ ARE tracked on purpose (see commit e20518d);
# only throwaway and machine-generated artifacts are listed here.

# Atomic-write leftovers. CheckpointedRun writes results.tmp and renames it, so a
# run killed mid-write leaves one behind.
*.tmp

# Written by scripts/bootstrap_gpu.sh with paths specific to the rented machine.
.env.gpu

# HuggingFace cache, if WORKSPACE ever resolves inside the repo.
hf-cache/

# Scratch sweeps used to smoke-test the runners — not results.
runs/m_*/
runs/plan_smoke/
runs/canary_smoke2/
# Convention for future throwaway runs: --output-dir runs/scratch_<whatever>
runs/scratch_*/
